 While David Tennant 's career success is mostly down to his portrayal of Doctor Who 's Tenth and Fourteenth Doctors, his incredible crime thriller Broadchurch ​​​​​​is probably the other title he's best known for. Trying to determine which title is the best of David Tennant's crime thrillers can be difficult; the Scottish actor is phenomenal in every show involving a murder mystery or shocking criminal investigation he stars in. However, there's no denying that his performance as DI Alec Hardy in Broadchurch is a standout in his filmography.
